  "notes": "The verb for pra (and the offering of the praise) is not stated; 'we offer' is supplied from the sense, havāmahe being the only finite verb. satām taken as gen. pl. of the participle 'being' ('of you who are'); 'of the good ones' is possible. jarayantam is the causative participle ('making age'); object not stated. ukṣita 'sprinkled' (or 'grown strong'; the sense in this context is not certain).",
